WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WRITING THE MEAN GIRLS
MUSICAL HAS BEEN A DREAM COME

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.573
TRUE.
THE ONLY AWKWARD THING IS PEOPLE

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:11.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
KEEP COMING TO ME SAYING, WHEN
ARE YOU GOING TO BE IN IT?

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:15.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
THE OTHER DAY CECILY STRONG
SAID, GIRL, YOU MUST BE IN IT.

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:19.652
&gt;&gt; WHAT I SAID WAS, GIRL, YOU
MUST BE IN IT MEANING YOU MUST

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
BE BUSY.
SHE HIGH FIVED ME REALLY HARD

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:25.792
AFTER.
IT WAS CLEAR SHE MISUNDERSTOOD.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.261
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK ANYBODY
EXPECTED TINA TO BE IN THE SHOW.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:32.832
&gt;&gt; SHE'S NOT REALLY LOUD ENOUGH.
SHE HAS A SMALL HEAD.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:36.136
&gt;&gt; THE THING THAT INSPIRED ME
WAS ONE DAY MY BEST FRIEND AIDY

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:39.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND I WERE LISTENING TO THE
HAMILTON SOUND TRACK.

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:44.310
&gt;&gt; TINA KEPT TALKING OVER IT
LIKE LIN WROTE THIS BUT THEY LET

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
HIM BE IN IT.
&gt;&gt; LEAVE ME OUT OF THIS.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:58.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; DID SHE SAY WE WERE BEST
FRIENDS?

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; TINA IN THE SHOW WILL BE
FETCH.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:02.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
MEANING IT'S NOT GOING TO
HAPPEN.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:06.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WE'RE GOING TO PUT TINA IN
THE SHOW.

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:08.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I AM SO EXCITED FOR ALL OF
US.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.305
AIDY AND CECILY ARE HERE TO
SUPPORT ME BECAUSE IT WAS THEIR

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:12.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
IDEA.
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:23.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I WAS TOLD IT WAS A BABY
SHOWER.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:24.918
&gt;&gt; SO I'M GOING TO SHADOW YOU
AND SEE WHAT PART IT MIGHT BE

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
FUN FOR THE AUDIENCE TO SEE ME
DO FOR A WEEK OR SO.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:34.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ONE MATINEE.
WE AGREED.

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:39.999
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT JUST THE SOUNDS.
YOU HAVE TO DO THE MOVEMENTS.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT IF MY REGINA LOG ROLLS
IN AND HITS A COOL POSE?

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:46.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OKAY.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S ACTUALLY BETTER.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.374
&gt;&gt; GOT IT.
&gt;&gt; WHAT KIND OF VIBRATO SHOULD I

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:51.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
USE?
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:52.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SOME PEOPLE DO A STRAIGHT
TONE LIKE -- ♪ BROADWAY ♪

00:01:52.812 --> 00:02:01.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUT MINE IS WIDER LIKE --
[ SINGING HALTINGLY ]

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:06.192
THIS IS KIND OF A GRETCHEN GOES
TO THE MALL LOOK.

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:12.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YOU LOOK GREAT.
&gt;&gt; MAYBE IS THE WIG BIG?

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:14.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT SURE YOU'RE PASSING
AS A TEENAGER.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ALSO I CAN'T DANCE IN THESE
SHOES.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:20.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
MY SHOES CAN ONLY BE BOUGHT IN
PARADE MAGAZINE.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:23.109
THEY HAVE COPPER IN THEM.
THEY ARE CALLED SUNSET STEPPERS

00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:25.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
AND THEY HAVE A POUCH TO HOLD
YOUR PILLS.

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:33.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; AM I DOING IT?

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:35.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THIS COULD BE A FUN USE OF
YOU.

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:38.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S LIKE A FUN EASTER EGG.
THEN I TAKE THE HEAD OFF.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:39.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY.
OR NOT.

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:47.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
FIVE, SIX, SEVEN, EIGHT.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:55.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; ULTIMATELY I REALIZED THAT

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:59.812
BROADWAY IS HARD AND THE PEOPLE
WHO DO IT ARE SUPER TALENTED.

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:06.085
MAYBE IT'S OKAY IF I CAN'T BE
LIKE LIN-MANUEL AND JAM MYSELF

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.187
INTO MY SHOW WHETHER PEOPLE LIKE
IT OR NOT.

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:11.758 size:84% position:42%
&gt;&gt; OKAY, YOU KNOW WHAT?
SHE JUST MADE THE BOOK.

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:15.795
LET ME TELL YOU ABOUT THIS
TINY-HEADED BITCH NAMED TINA.

